    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. some of those feel a bit simplified though. like, when people talk about the legal or logistical issues, what are the actual specific arguments they make? like regarding who would actually qualify or how it would even be funded? is there more to it than just saying 'the past is over'?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
